WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Connecting rod bolt
What it does: Keeps the rod big end closed under alternating engine loads.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Connecting rod bolt
How it works: The nut produces clamping force.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Connecting rod bolt
How it moves: Does not turn within the rod; travels and swings with the assembly to which it is secured.
